  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Fa Jin — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to use your cursed energy to amplify your Fa Jin. You can spend 3 cursed energy as an action to launch a blast of compressed air using Jin charges, which have different effects based on the weapon you use.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Attack</th>\n<th></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Effect</th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Unarmed or Bludgeoning</td>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">15 feet cone, Con save, 2D6 bludgeoning damage per Jin charge, knocked prone on a failed save</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Slashing or Piercing</td>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">30 feet line, Dex save, 2D10 slashing damage per Jin charge</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
   "chat": ""
  },
